gText_Truck_Intro::
	.string "{COLOR DARK_GRAY}The moving truck rumbles along\n"
	.string "winding road to LITTLEROOT TOWN…{COLOR DARK_GRAY}\n"
	.string "You sit quietly among boxes. Watching\n"
	.string "HOENN countryside roll by through small\n"
	.string "window. The DRIVER glances back through\n"
	.string "the rear window. {COLOR BLUE}DRIVER: Pretty\n"
	.string "quiet back there, kid. Nervous about\n"
	.string "move? {COLOR GREEN}{PLAYER}: A little, I\n"
	.string "guess. It's been a while since we've\n"
	.string "moved somewhere new. {COLOR BLUE}DRIVER:\n"
	.string "HOENN's a good place for fresh starts.\n"
	.string "I've been driving this route for years.\n"
	.string "Starting over can be a good thing\n"
	.string "sometimes, you know? {COLOR GREEN}{PLAYER}:\n"
	.string "Starting over, huh? If only it was\n"
	.string "that easy…{COLOR DARK_GRAY}$"

gText_Truck_MysteriousBox::
	.string "An old wooden box with strange symbols\n"
	.string "carved into its surface. {COLOR GREEN}{PLAYER}:\n"
	.string "What's with this box? These symbols look\n"
	.string "ancient.{COLOR DARK_GRAY} {COLOR BLUE}DRIVER:\n"
	.string "Oh, that old thing? Found it in storage.\n"
	.string "Previous owner left it. Figured someone\n"
	.string "might want it. The box feels warm to\n"
	.string "the touch, despite cool air in truck.\n"
	.string "{COLOR GREEN}{PLAYER}: It's… glowing slightly.\n"
	.string "That's not normal, is it?{COLOR DARK_GRAY}\n"
	.string "{COLOR BLUE}DRIVER: HOENN's full of strange\n"
	.string "things, kid. You'll get used to it.$"

gText_Truck_DevenCorpBox::
	.string "A sleek metallic container bearing DEVON\n"
	.string "CORPORATION logo, very sleek. {COLOR GREEN}{PLAYER}:\n"
	.string "DEVON CORPORATION? What kind of company\n"
	.string "is that?{COLOR DARK_GRAY} {COLOR BLUE}DRIVER:\n"
	.string "Big tech company in RUSTBORO. They make\n"
	.string "all sorts of gadgets for trainers, and\n"
	.string "other high-tech items. Oh, that reminds\n"
	.string "me! There's something in there I found\n"
	.string "after my last delivery. Inside, you spot\n"
	.string "a peculiar bracelet with a crystalline\n"
	.string "centerpiece, and other high-tech features.\n"
	.string "{COLOR BLUE}DRIVER: They said I could keep\n"
	.string "it if I wanted, but jewelry's not really\n"
	.string "my style, I prefer more practical items.\n"
	.string "You can have it if you like, kid, it looks\n"
	.string "like it'd suit a young trainer. {PLAYER}\n"
	.string "obtained the MEGA RING! {COLOR GREEN}{PLAYER}:\n"
	.string "This bracelet feels… familiar somehow,\n"
	.string "like it's been waiting. {COLOR BLUE}DRIVER:\n"
	.string "Huh, that's interesting, maybe it was\n"
	.string "meant to be yours, who knows?$"

gText_Truck_MemoryBox::
	.string "A simple cardboard box labeled 'MEMORIES'\n"
	.string "in your mother's handwriting. {COLOR GREEN}{PLAYER}:\n"
	.string "Mom packed our old photos and stuff in\n"
	.string "here.{COLOR DARK_GRAY} {COLOR BLUE}DRIVER:\n"
	.string "Memories are important. But don't let\n"
	.string "them hold you back from making new ones.\n"
	.string "HOENN's got plenty of adventures waiting\n"
	.string "for someone like you. {COLOR GREEN}{PLAYER}:\n"
	.string "Someone like me? {COLOR BLUE}DRIVER: Trust\n"
	.string "me, kid. The POKéMON here can sense things\n"
	.string "about people that even we don't know about\n"
	.string "ourselves.$"

gText_Truck_PlayerReflection::
	.string "{COLOR BLUE}DRIVER: Whatever you're leaving\n"
	.string "behind, HOENN has a way of helping people\n"
	.string "find their true path. {COLOR GREEN}{PLAYER}:\n"
	.string "You really think so?{COLOR DARK_GRAY} {COLOR BLUE}DRIVER:\n"
	.string "I've seen it happen before. Young trainers\n"
	.string "come here carrying all sorts of burdens…\n"
	.string "But there's something special about this\n"
	.string "region. The legends say the land itself\n"
	.string "chooses its champions. {COLOR GREEN}{PLAYER}:\n"
	.string "Champions, huh…{COLOR DARK_GRAY}$"
	.string "this region. The legends say the\l"
	.string "land itself chooses its champions.\p"
	.string "{COLOR GREEN}{PLAYER}: Champions, huh…{COLOR DARK_GRAY}$"

gText_Truck_ReadyToExit::
	.string "The truck slows down, approaching\l"
	.string "LITTLEROOT TOWN. Time to start\l"
	.string "your new chapter!\p"
	.string "{COLOR BLUE}DRIVER: Here we are!\n"
	.string "LITTLEROOT TOWN! Time to start that\l"
	.string "new chapter of yours!\p"
	.string "{COLOR GREEN}{PLAYER}: Thanks for the ride…\p"
	.string "and advice. And the bracelet.{COLOR DARK_GRAY}\p"
	.string "{COLOR BLUE}DRIVER: Don't mention it, kid.\n"
	.string "Something tells me you're going\l"
	.string "to need it.\p"
	.string "{COLOR GREEN}{PLAYER}: Here goes nothing…{COLOR DARK_GRAY}$"
